{"SystemName":"OrderPaid.CustomerNotification","Title":"{{Store.Name}} - Sipari\u015F #{{Order.OrderNumber}} \u00F6demesi al\u0131nd\u0131","Content":"\u003Cdiv style=\u0022font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #eaeaea; border-radius: 5px;\u0022\u003E\\n  \u003Cdiv style=\u0022text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\u0022\u003E\\n    \u003Ca href=\u0022{{Store.URL}}\u0022 style=\u0022text-decoration: none; color: #333; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\u0022\u003E{{Store.Name}}\u003C/a\u003E\\n  \u003C/div\u003E\\n  \\n  \u003Cdiv style=\u0022background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px;\u0022\u003E\\n    \u003Ch2 style=\u0022color: #4CAF50; margin-top: 0;\u0022\u003E\u00D6demeniz Ba\u015Far\u0131yla Al\u0131nd\u0131!\u003C/h2\u003E\\n    \u003Cp\u003EMerhaba {{Order.CustomerFullName}},\u003C/p\u003E\\n    \u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022{{Store.URL}}\u0022 style=\u0022color: #3498db; text-decoration: none;\u0022\u003E{{Store.Name}}\u003C/a\u003E\u0027den al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015F yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z i\u00E7in te\u015Fekk\u00FCr ederiz. #{{Order.OrderNumber}} numaral\u0131 sipari\u015Finizin \u00F6demesi ba\u015Far\u0131yla al\u0131nm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r. Sipari\u015F \u00F6zeti a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da yer almaktad\u0131r.\u003C/p\u003E\\n  \u003C/div\u003E\\n  \\n  \u003Cdiv style=\u0022margin-bottom: 20px;\u0022\u003E\\n    \u003Ch3 style=\u0022border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px; color: #333;\u0022\u003ESipari\u015F Bilgileri\u003C/h3\u003E\\n    \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESipari\u015F Numaras\u0131:\u003C/strong\u003E {{Order.OrderNumber}}\u003C/p\u003E\\n    \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESipari\u015F Detaylar\u0131:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ca href=\u0022{{Order.OrderURLForCustomer}}\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 style=\u0022color: #3498db;\u0022\u003ESipari\u015Fi G\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FCle\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\\n    \u003Cp\